    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/yoga-trainer/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Yoga Trainer theme is a feature-rich and versatile solution designed specifically for yoga studios, individual trainers, wellness coaches, meditation instructors, mindfulness coaches, and fitness professionals looking to create an engaging online presence. Tailored for a variety of yoga practices, including yoga for mindfulness, yoga for weight loss, yoga for mental health, corporate yoga, workplace yoga, yoga for athletes, runners, cyclists, sound healing yoga, partner yoga, yoga and mental health, yoga and spirituality and dynamic power flow yoga, it’s perfect for showcasing offerings such as meditation classes, pranayama sessions, and virtual yoga classes. Visually stunning and fully customizable, the theme offers a serene and modern design that reflects the tranquility of yoga while including options to display yoga sequences, routines, and video tutorials for beginners, intermediates, and advanced practitioners. Its responsive layout ensures your website looks great on all devices, while features like social media integration, image galleries, testimonials, and class schedules enhance user engagement. Translation-ready and globally accessible, it also supports the Contact Form 7 plugin for class bookings, inquiries, and client communication, making it easy for yoga trainers and wellness coaches to manage appointments and connect with their audience. Demo Link - https://pattern.cretathemes.com/yoga-trainer/"
    },
